# Build from public source only; Git ignores do not protect Docker contexts.
**
!.clang-format
!.dockerignore
!CMakeLists.txt
!Dockerfile
!LICENSE
!README.md
!ruff.toml
!runtime.lock.json
!native/
!native/**
!patches/
!patches/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!third_party/
!third_party/**
!docs/
!docs/**
!examples/
!examples/**
!manifests/
!manifests/**
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/*.gguf
**/*.safetensors
**/*.pt

# Keep private review worksheets out of container source/runtime stages too.
docs/CLAIMS-REVIEW.md
docs/LOCAL-RELEASE-CANDIDATE.md
docs/MODEL-CARD-12B.md
docs/MODEL-CARD-NVFP4.md
docs/MODEL-CARD-E4B.md
